```js
AISYS.defineGame({
  schema: 1, kit: "endless-runner",
  id: "rimba-lari", title: "Rimba Lari", seed: "rimba-lari-01",
  theme: { preset: "cartoon" },

  player: { x: 220, w: 44, h: 56, gravity: 2400, jumpVelocity: 900, lives: 3, invulnerableSec: 1.2 },
  world:  { groundY: 600, speed: 420, maxSpeed: 720, accel: 10 },

  spawner: {
    interval: [0.9, 1.5],
    table: [
      { type: "hazard", id: "batu-lumut", w: 44, h: 48, weight: 3 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "akar-pohon", w: 90, h: 24, weight: 2 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "genangan",   w: 70, h: 90, weight: 1 },
      { type: "item", weight: 5, heights: ["ground", "mid", "high"] }
    ]
  },

  rules: {
    perSecond: 5,
    correct: { score: 50, sfx: "coin" },
    wrong:   { score: -20, sfx: "hit", showExplain: true },
    hazard:  { lives: -1, sfx: "hit", shake: 8 },
    combo:   { step: 5, max: 4 },
    difficulty: { everySec: 12, speed: 30 }
  }
});
// END_OF_MANIFEST
```

**Rimba Lari** adalah arcade runner bertema hutan tropis dengan tema Cartoon dan kesulitan Menantang, di mana pemain melompati batu berlumut, akar, dan genangan sambil mengumpulkan koin. Saya memakai rintangan genangan yang tinggi (90) dengan lebar lebih sempit (70) agar tetap bisa dilompati pada kecepatan Menantang.
